<title>USA: TABLE- Telemundo Group Q2 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Telemundo Group Q2 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI, Fla. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $0.17     loss	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net	  loss	  1,731     loss	 2,190</p>
<p> Revs			51,681		   54,311</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,166		   10,000</p>
<p>Six Months</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	   1.36     loss	 $2.91</p>
<p> Net	  loss	 13,788     loss	29,124</p>
<p> Revs			90,781		   92,578</p>
<p> Avg			 10,161		   10,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Telemundo Group Inc's first half of 1996 earnings include an extraordinary item (the etinguishement of debt) of $17.2 million, or $1.72 a share.</p>
<p>Without the charge, the company would have posted a net loss of $11.9 million, or $1.19 a share, in the first half of 1996.</p>
